      "message": "Is the expected implementation of this to raise the uclamp.min or other action that causes a temporary frequency increase?\n\nHow does the HAL know what value to use for the uclamp.min?\nHow does the HAL know which frequency domains to apply this to?\nHow does the HAL know when the uclamp.min can be restored to it\u0027s \"normal\" value?",
