      "message": "Do we know what the test workload is?\n\nSo this is the same as SUSTAINED_PERFORMANCE except that the clocks are fixed at the highest sustainable? SUSTAINED_PERFORMANCE has been difficult for partners to tune so it is often a very conservative setting.",
      "revId": "371c6fe57763a0aabb15b5ba3b16e37ff5542f96",
