    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "742d1fa4_c0582fb8",
        "filename": "power/aidl/android/hardware/power/ThreadHint.aidl",
        "patchSetId": 14
      },
      "lineNbr": 34,
      "author": {
        "id": 1069543
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-01-31T01:56:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What is the pain-point being addressed by HIGH_UTILIZATION?\n\nIs it priming the clocks, in which case the implementation of this would be to increase uclamp.min for the specified tid and that value persists for the lifetime of the thread. This could be done with schedtune too. In both cases, the challenge is to map \"heavy\" to an actual value that can be used. We probably don\u0027t want to use maxFreq for power reasons, but anything else might be \"heavy\" enough and a one-value-fits-all workloads might be hard to find. Might need to make this adaptive in some way.\n\n...or is the pain-point that heavy tasks get placed on little-cores so implementation would be to change the affinity to big cores if possible?",
      "revId": "371c6fe57763a0aabb15b5ba3b16e37ff5542f96",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "08d072b0_005dc12d",
        "filename": "power/aidl/android/hardware/power/ThreadHint.aidl",
        "patchSetId": 14
      },
      "lineNbr": 41,
      "author": {
        "id": 1069543
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-01-31T01:56:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Presumably this would be implemented by setting the uclamp low_latency property (\u003d schedtune\u0027s perfer_idle property). This implies that other threads in the top-app group do not have the property set (it normally is set for top-app).\n\nMaybe an abuse mitigation for this includes a policy where any app uses these hints, the default for this becomes !low_latency and the top-app default uclamp.min is 0 (or even better uclamp.max is set aggressively unless HIGH_UTILIZATION is set for a task).",
      "revId": "371c6fe57763a0aabb15b5ba3b16e37ff5542f96",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
